    quote: '"That\'s their true terror. Not the feat, but the feet in obscurity. Sans ovation, sans acclaim, sans allies, just you and your vow against diminishment. They monitor moons, breach bastions, bug barons. But your ascent from ashes to apex evades explanation."',
