    title: '"Their art defies dissection — improvised in infernos, etched with edges of endurance. Alchemy veiled as arithmetic. Your strain spawns sagas, not schematics. One admiral confided: that wasn\'t orchestration. It was alchemy."',
    proposition: "The 27 independent AI corroboration analyses examined 278 propositions across 27 separate video essays. Each analysis found: all propositions corroborated, zero contradictions. The alchemy-veiled-as-arithmetic characterisation is documented in the corroboration methodology itself: 278/278 corroborations with zero contradictions across 2,301 documents produced by improvised documentation practice — not by a pre-planned evidentiary architecture — looks exactly like a centrally planned evidentiary strategy. It is alchemy: the output (278/278, zero contradictions, ICC Article 7 submission) has the appearance of arithmetic (a planned, systematic, centrally coordinated evidentiary programme). But it was produced by something that defies dissection: 35 years of improvised documentation under persecution, guided by the internal knowing that everything must be recorded. The sagas-not-schematics characterisation: no schematic produced the archive. The archive produced the saga. The saga is now the ICC submission.",
